{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画  コープスパーティーBook of Shadows"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関東5劇場にて昨日7月30日から公開しました〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国順次ロードショーとなります！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日、みんなで舞台挨拶を行いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださった皆さんありがとうございましたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝早くから映画を観て、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"内容的に皆さんのお顔が曇る感じでちょっと申し訳なかったですが、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それくらい怖い体験を私達でお届け出来たのだと思うと嬉しすぎます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"現場は和気あいあいと、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しく、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"怖い作品を作っていましたヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コープスパーティーは、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続編という事で、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初このお話を聞いた時に、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私にそんな事が出来るのかな。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と、実は前回よりも不安だったんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それは、1作目を経験しているから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の今出来るお芝居のレベルも知っているから、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に自分が出来るのか怖かったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、前と違う自分になっていました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出来ないなら、分かるように聞いてみよう、ワークショップ行こう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーに教えてもらおう！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分が出来る範囲でですが、準備して行けたかなと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだまだまだ、お芝居レベルでは学ばなくてはいけません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"が、自分に来たせっかくのチャンス。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この運を沢山の人に観て頂きたいですヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こわーいけどねっ！！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"女子組  （祁答院さんは、半分女子笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今井さんに今年もあえて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"CD沢山聴きますね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いーっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"のんちゃんお稽古頑張れ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この2人のカップル感。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんが彼氏みたいにボーイッシュ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虹花ちゃん年下なのに、おねいさんみたいだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2016/07/31/3296639/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木坂からのコープス！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近始めたハーブティーを片手に今日も楽しむぞ〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヨロピクピク〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}